{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_caper_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_caper_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"快樂之地","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_caper_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"25e69bc6c66a3b21255adf82c5412c8d8e7849f9313d5eed0d5f5ab8fd3c512d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我連續完成了十次“香檳杯晃晃晃”沒吐出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我連續完成了二十次“吊帶褲搖搖搖”，也沒吐出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。兩位遊客，把你們的票券交上來，我會幫你們兌換抽獎機會喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看……完成十次“香檳杯晃晃晃”和二十次“吊帶褲搖搖搖”，總共可以抽獎三次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，請抽獎，祝你們好運～"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果中了一等獎，我要買下街對面的那幢兩層樓的房子，這樣每天一下樓就能來遊樂場了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過拿個四等獎也行啊，那是盒牌工業最新款的遊艇，賣出去至少能還清欠“利齒幫”的保護費……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經把老媽的店鋪抵押給他們了，但還差一點錢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不敢做那些美夢，別又是“銘謝惠顧”就行……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要能中獎，就不枉我強忍著嘔吐感，堅持搖了二十次……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出了出了，快看看中了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我現在還是有點眼花，看不清楚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇喔，這可真不得了，你們的運氣可真好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜二位，這是今日特別大獎——“再來一百次”體驗券！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今日特別大獎？“再來一百次”？也就是說，我還能再抽獎一百次？太棒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，那多沒意思啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不管怎麼說，這一定是我中的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我中的！你滾開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，不要爭搶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“再來一百次”的意思是，你們可以再免費體驗“香檳杯晃晃晃”或者“吊帶褲搖搖搖”一百次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位將會共用一百次機會，夠你們玩個痛快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客&目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！嘔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，還好我躲得快，差點吐在我身上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啦，這位招待大姐，讓你睡了這麼久……你的工作服我完好無損地還給你了！換班！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那兩個人好像一點也不喜歡我準備的特別大獎啊，來遊樂場不就是為了玩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不用錢玩個夠，這樣還不開心，真奇怪……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，來一杯“雙重日出”特調。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了紅毛，別裝模作樣了，我才沒跟你約定過這麼土的接頭暗號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我是真的想點一杯嚐嚐看。那些收保護費的傢伙都人手一杯，有那麼好喝嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我“下班”了，你等這位招待大姐醒過來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那算了……還是交換情報比較重要，我們找個方便說話的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，搞清楚那幫收保護費的人的底細了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我跟在幾個人後面，找到了他們的老巢……比想像中的要麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些收保護費的，他們背靠的是這片街區最大的幫派——“利齒幫”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們如果想把他們全部從遊樂場裡趕出去，就意味著要和整個幫派作對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準確地說，我們要想在這片街區待著，就得遵守“利齒幫”的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那正好，反正我最擅長的就是破壞規矩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……卡莉，我們別管他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他們繼續留在遊樂場裡收保護費，我們也能玩得很開心，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要別跟我們要錢，也不用一定要把他們都趕出去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅毛，我和你說過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來多索雷斯，就是為了找一個真正快樂的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然在遊樂場裡玩確實很快樂，但總是有人來破壞它的樂趣，我看不順眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以不讓人過得安穩快樂來威脅別人，並以此獲利的傢伙，最可惡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是老大，肯定不會讓我的手下做這種事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就去搞定他們的頭頭吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂！不管他們老大是退伍軍人還是市長的人，反正只要把他打服了就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你怎麼還是這麼魯莽，就不能用聰明一點的辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，我見過那傢伙。我以我軍旅生涯中獲得的所有榮譽向你保證，只要是單挑，他肯定打不過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還得感謝你當年把我“送”去參軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）但是如果他真的是市長的人，就算你打贏了，事後不是一樣會有人找你算帳嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒事，我還以為你一直因為那件事記恨我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我把你騙上招兵的車，你大概還能再做幾年街區的老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，說什麼呢，我不怪你。我都想清楚了，當年要是沒坐上那輛車，我也不會來到多索雷斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒坐上那輛車……我這輩子，大概就只能做個貧民窟街區的老大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貧民窟有什麼不好？我還寧可繼續生活在那片街區裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在那雙紅手套之下，躍躍一直都能感受到源石結晶的觸感。\n她本來以為自己已經習慣，但總有一些時刻，讓她無法忽視它的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算啦，現在我們也都沒得選了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"*玻利瓦爾省俚語*，什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……是你這小子把罐子踢到我臉上的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是我，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你，你是不是跟剛才那個賣氣球的老爺爺要保護費？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囂張的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"關你什麼事？我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別和他廢話了，卡莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這一拳真夠狠！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……紅毛，你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，你為什麼要翻這傢伙的口袋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼？當然是把他收的錢都拿走啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，那記得還給賣氣球的老爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，這些錢不是全都是從那個老爺爺那裡搶來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，你別這麼看著我。我拿這些錢跟他買幾個氣球，可以了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我們先分頭行動吧，我要去辦點事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呿，好啊，那我們就先各幹各的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅毛那傢伙……一整天都沒見到他的人影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他應該把那些錢還給老爺爺了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了，隨便他吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……卡莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼蹲在這裡？還有這麼多空啤酒罐……你是喝了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，是啊，我也不知道我喝了多少……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你知道嗎，以前在貧民窟的時候……我老爹得擦二十雙皮鞋，才捨得幫自己買一罐冰啤酒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受到什麼刺激了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刺激？哈哈，在多索雷斯，我每一天都在受刺激……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉……你看到了吧，今天我一拳就幹倒了一個小嘍囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光他今天收的保護費，就可以買這麼多……這麼多啤酒……憑什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅毛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我們應該拿的錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，說是這麼說……但是我們要的快樂，不就是有花不完的錢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，等我們打倒了“利齒幫”的頭頭……我們來當老大吧，我們一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也能收保護費，我們也能有花不完的錢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，我可以幫老爹換個新房子，就買在酒館旁邊，他想喝多少就喝多少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以把你媽接過來，在這裡開個大工廠！哈哈，肯定很氣派！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是這樣的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家？那……媽媽呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"媽媽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，媽媽……我很想你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你過得好不好？那些壞傢伙沒再來收保護費吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"媽媽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我一直沒寫信給你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找一個地方，一個真正快樂的地方……能把你也接過來，我們一起生活……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有人趕我走，也不會有人砸你的工作室……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得了礦石病，但我也不會增加你的負擔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我到現在也沒有找到這樣的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"媽媽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，卡莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"媽媽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算賣掉全部家當，我也要把你治好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，媽媽，別這麼說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"媽媽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只要你快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望……你也快樂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，誰教你這麼寫的？語氣太兇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該這樣，在開頭寫上“尊敬的頭頭”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不行，字跡太潦草了，重寫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，然後再寫上時間和地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“下個星期五晚上七點，在你們的據點。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我知道接下來要寫什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你等著，我來找你單挑。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重來，最後一句寫——“不知您有沒有時間？我有事想找您面談。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，我不懂啊，這可是一封挑戰書，我們有必要對他那麼禮貌嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來好像我們很怕他一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要是真的覺得我們怕他，那才有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，聽你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那到時候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到約定時間了，我就先去遊樂場裡製造點小混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候他們的人都被我引過來，你就趁他們據點防衛空虛，去找他們的頭頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你應該打得過他吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就準備好了武器，哼，我告訴你，那可是好東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等事成之後，我們就能成為“利齒幫”的頭頭，成為遊樂場的頭頭……說不定，還能成為多索雷斯的頭頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙，也太樂觀了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不怕我再一次把你騙得團團轉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老實說，剛和你再見面時，我是想過狠狠揍你一頓，讓你也嘗一嘗我當兵時吃的那些苦頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我又轉念一想，你腦子比我好，又早就認識了……當朋友總比當仇人好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我很確定。卡莉，選擇跟著你混，真的沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等事成之後再這麼說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可別搞砸囉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……紅毛那傢伙，一聊起天來真是沒完沒了。他媽媽難道沒告訴他十點之前要上床睡覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他對我們的作戰計劃也太有信心了，居然能睡得那麼香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……要是真的按照原計劃來，他肯定當不上什麼頭頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，大概他都沒辦法活著離開“利齒幫”的老巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，挑戰書已經發出去了……既然要搗亂，就痛快地大鬧一場吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，讓這些多索雷斯人見識見識什麼才是真正的快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找找……紅毛要帶過去的武器，應該就放在這裡吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒錯，這樣肯定會更好玩的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，還要先預訂個好位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，您好，請問是希魯斯空中飯店嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"票，我的票呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易完成了二十次“香檳杯晃晃晃”，有人偷了我的票！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的包包！我的包包！怎麼飛到吊燈上去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腳亂的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼……誰把爆米花糖漿灑在地上了？！你們賠我新買的簽名版球鞋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"請大家保持秩序！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"遊樂場有非法闖入者，請大家保持冷靜，聽從我們的指揮排隊疏散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室內廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（女聲）噔噔噔～各位客人晚安，請按照安全指示，移步遊樂場門前廣場，我們為大家準備了小禮品～"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室內廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（女聲）記得檢查好自己的墨鏡、手錶、高跟鞋，千萬不要有東西遺落在遊樂場內，如果……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室內廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（男聲）你這傢伙，怎麼闖進——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室內廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（擊打聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"室內廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（女聲）咳咳，總而言之，祝大家有個快樂的夜晚~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小禮品？是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊，去看看吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腳亂的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你沒長眼睛嗎？別踩我的鞋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，別堵在這裡，都動起來，趕快去外面找個好位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨示意）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……接下來就看我的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g1_dossolesstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都這麼久了，哪有什麼小禮品……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腳亂的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，遊樂場的工作人員呢？就讓我們在外面乾等？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我跟著那傢伙追出來了，但門口人太多了，找不到她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，老大那邊有情況？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別心急嘛，時間也差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……五，四，三，二，一，好戲開場囉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你這傢伙開著貨車闖進我這裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"貨車一頭撞進了“利齒幫”的老巢，車屁股卻還露在外面。\n還算是個有氣勢的出場，紅毛心想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，原本這間破房子就漏雨，這下連風都擋不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找麻煩？你把我的迎客廳都撞爛了，不打算給我個解釋？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼情況？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是說好的單挑嗎？怎麼這裡還有這麼多人？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不管了……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅毛默不作聲地打開貨車後廂。\n那架他從老戰友那裡搞到手的源石火炮，在戰場上，總是能精準地把敵人們炸得血肉橫飛。\n它絕對算得上是大殺器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人，還是一群人，沒什麼區別……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅毛想起了躍躍的囑託。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那時，他還不太理解躍躍為何把“大殺器”講得像小糖果一樣。\n然而，當貨廂打開之後……他以為自己看錯了，揉了揉眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*玻利瓦爾省俚語*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅毛終於理解了。\n那架原本應該存在的源石火炮消失不見了，取而代之的卻是一些不知從哪裡來的彩色紙箱子。\n他看到了紙箱子上印的卡通圖案，封口的膠帶上還寫著“歡樂時光”的字樣。\n他還看到了計時器與被點燃的引線，更要命的是，那引線即將燒到盡頭……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一束束禮炮沖天而去，在夜空中綻放。\n花簇形的，愛心形的，羽獸形的……剎那間，煙火點綴著多索雷斯的夜空，在天上映出酒綠燈紅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g1_dossolesstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怎麼樣？夠精彩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要準備這麼氣派的煙火秀，可不簡單喔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼啊，這就是所謂的小禮品？吵死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頭暈的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是，也太吵了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說啊，煙火很好看啊，可惜好多都被高樓擋住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手忙的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不提前通知，安排更好的觀賞點呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"目眩的遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀算了，無聊無聊，我們能不能回遊樂場裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不理解這些多索雷斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要抬起頭，每個人都能看見一點煙火……這難道還不夠棒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還在貧民窟的時候，每次城市裡放煙火，媽媽都會叫我一起看……那是我們也能分享到的快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……無所謂啦，他們不懂就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，紅毛那邊……他們一定會很喜歡這份驚喜的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾天後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保全人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"讓一讓，讓一讓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇喔，好大的陣仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多掛著花束和氣球的車，車牌號還都是連著的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，車隊中的一輛車駛離隊伍，停在躍躍的身邊。\n駕駛室的車門打開，下來了一個熟悉的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉！我總算見到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天之後你去哪裡了，連最愛的遊樂場也不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？看起來也忙得很啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新車不錯喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這是老大的車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔對了，你還不知道吧？我已經加入“利齒幫”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，原來是煙火……居然是煙火！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完了……全完了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚喜的女子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天啊！甜心，好棒的煙火秀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚喜的女子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真沒想到，我還以為你又要打打殺殺的……原來你是想為我準備一個驚喜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊……沒錯！我可是籌備了很久呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你幫我一起準備的，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？對、對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我的寶貝，你快點去換件衣服吧。等一下我們去吃頓難忘的晚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚喜的女子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！甜心，我很期待喔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……請問……還需要我做什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，已經足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙，真是讓我刮目相看啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……不……對不起……我會想辦法幫您把牆補好的！我一定會賠償的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"賠償？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還想賠償？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為我辦了件大事，我怎麼會讓你賠錢呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我正煩惱什麼時候求婚呢，哼，看來就是今天了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來人，去幫我訂全多索雷斯視野最好的餐廳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”小弟","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"老大！希魯斯空中飯店打來電話了，問我們預訂的位置還要不要留！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？已經預訂了？是你訂的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，也許……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊，小子。我記住你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“利齒幫”頭頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，備車！我現在就去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，那女孩對煙火秀讚不絕口，然後……老大就求婚成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大喜出望外，當場就要拉我加入……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的婚禮就定在今天晚上。這個車隊，就是前往婚禮現場的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢……恭喜恭喜，那不是滿好的嘛，我的作戰計劃很成功啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，絕對不會更成功了，真沒想到你居然有這樣的鬼點子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，說真的，當時我緊張死了！你如果在旁邊，肯定能聽到我的汗珠落在地上的聲音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然你加入了“利齒幫”，那就早點當上老大，別讓小弟們再收保護費了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛……我們不說這個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，上車吧！我帶著你，我們一起加入“利齒幫”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，沒什麼意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算要去，也是去搗亂，肯定不會受歡迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我已經打算要離開多索雷斯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡莉，只要我們加入了“利齒幫”，遊樂場就能隨便進，不會再有人來騷擾我們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼了，卡莉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅毛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的多索雷斯……不就是你要找的“快樂之地”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躍躍","speakerId":"avg_4100_caper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得這裡沒有我要找的快樂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，婚車上掛著的慶典氣球都被放飛，緩緩地升上天空，在孩子們的歡呼聲中，所有人的注意力都被吸引了過去。\n等紅毛回過神時，躍躍已經消失得無影無蹤了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
